results.projectdescription:
Field Review - Addition / Alteration - Interior alteration to change the use of the existing Retail Store to a temporary sales presentation centre (similar to General Office) for a limited period of time expiring Oct 18, 2019, unless extended in writing by the Director of Planning, and also interior alterations to provide tenant improvements to create a display bathroom and display kitchen.    
   
Conditions of approval:    
(1) The proposed presentation centre is approved for a limited period of time expiring Oct 18th, 2019 unless extended in writing by the Director of Planning;    
   
(2) All mock-up display suite walls, kitchen equipment, plumbing fixtures are to be removed on or before the expiry date or at the time the tenant vacates the building; 
   
(3) The display kitchen and bathroom fixtures are NON-WORKING fixtures only (not to be plumbed);
   
(4) All glazing to remain clear and unobstructed at all times. No films, signage, shelving or similar elements to be installed without further approval from the Director of Planning.    

Okay for field review as per E.Kai Oct18/18

Letter of assurance rcvd A Cheung 604.685.2088

